    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../core/codec/Encoder.html#encode(org.reactivestreams.Publisher,org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBufferFactory,org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType,java.util.Map)\">Encoder</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../core/codec/Encoder.html#encode(org.reactivestreams.Publisher,org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBufferFactory,org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType,java.util.Map)\">Encoder</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>elementType</code> - the expected type of elements in the input stream;\nthis type must have been previously passed to the <a href=\"../../../core/codec/Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>Encoder.canEncode(ResolvableType, MimeType)</code></a>\nmethod and it must have returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>elementType</code> - 输入流中元素的预期类型；此类型必须已先前传递给<a href=\"../../../core/codec/Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>Encoder.canEncode(ResolvableType, MimeType)</code></a>方法，且该方法必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>inputStream</code> - the input stream of Objects to encode. If the input should be\nencoded as a single value rather than as a stream of elements, an instance of\n<code>Mono</code> should be used.",
      "translation": "`inputStream` - 要编码的对象输入流。如果输入应作为单个值而非元素流进行编码，则应使用 `Mono` 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - for creating output stream <code>DataBuffer</code>'s",
      "translation": "<code>bufferFactory</code> - 用于创建输出流 <code>DataBuffer</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mimeType</code> - the MIME type for the output content (optional)",
      "translation": "<code>mimeType</code> - 输出内容的 MIME 类型（可选）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>hints</code> - additional information about how to encode",
      "translation": "<code>hints</code> - 关于如何编码的附加信息",
